      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 47,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "Up to ten containers with the largest estimated restart count during the hour ending at the selected range end. This is always a one-hour window. Counts may be fractional because Prometheus estimates between samples. An empty table means no detected restarts if source metrics are available.",
      "datasource": {
